  ('megeve-france', '01F', 'Megève', 'France', 'The chic French classic', 'live', 'verified', 'northernLights', 'French Alps', '{"ski","ultra","culinary","romance","wellness","family"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["Chic Pays du Mont-Blanc classic (Haute-Savoie), shaped in the 1920s by the ROTHSCHILDS as a French answer to St Moritz; genuine cobbled old village (Saint-Jean-Baptiste church, horse-drawn sleighs)","GENTLE, tree-lined skiing (Mont d''Arbois/Rochebrune/Mont Joux/Mont Joly) - part of Evasion Mont-Blanc (~445 km marketed / ~185 km measured Megeve-Saint-Gervais, ~60 lifts); low village ~1,113 m, top ~2,350 m","CLOSEST big French resort to a major airport - Geneva ~1-1.25 hr (Lyon secondary; rail Sallanches); the easiest big-resort arrival in the French Alps","Flocons de Sel (Emmanuel Renaut) = 3 MICHELIN STARS (2003/2006/2012) - one of a handful of 3-star tables in the French Alps; the heart of Megeve gastronomy","Deep luxury cluster: Four Seasons Megeve (details flagged - site blocked), Les Fermes de Marie (5-star, Sibuet, Pure Altitude spa), Flocons de Sel hotel (Relais & Chateaux), Le Chalet Zannier","Season ~mid-Dec-early Apr (12 Dec 2026-4 Apr 2027); adult day pass ~EUR 63.50 (Evasion multi-day flagged); snowmaking reliance at low altitude (coverage flag)","Genuine SUMMER season: International Jumping of Megeve (equestrian, Jul 2026) + Megeve Blues Festival (Jul-Aug 2026) + golf + hiking","US pass (Ikon) NOT known partner - do not assert (Ikon Alps = Chamonix/Zermatt/Dolomiti/Kitzbuhel/St Moritz); HELI-SKIING BANNED IN FRANCE - guided touring only; NO natural hot springs"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 (Europe) / 15 SAMU / 17 police / 18 fire / 114 SMS; mountain rescue via 112 / PGHM (Haute-Savoie / Mont-Blanc)","hospital":"Resort medical services; nearest hospital Centre Hospitalier Pays du Mont-Blanc (Sallanches); larger cases Annecy; heli evac SMUR/PGHM (verify)","advisory_level":"L2","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"Lower-altitude tree-lined resort (village ~1,113 m, top ~2,350 m) so AMS not a factor + comparatively lower in-bounds avalanche exposure - BUT off-piste + upper Mont Joly still carry real avalanche risk: Meteo-France BERA, 5-level scale, massif Aravis vs Mont-Blanc (likely Aravis - confirm); transceiver/shovel/probe + UIAGM guide off-piste; NO heli-skiing (banned in France); low base = thin/icy cover + snowmaking early/late; cold + winter mountain roads; rescue 112/PGHM","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/france","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-08-11T10:17:02+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, February European half-terms + Easter; luxury hotels + Michelin tables at multiples + min-stay","shoulder":"Early Dec (opening; altitude-limited snow-security) + March (sun, still-good high snow, softer rates)","green":"Genuine summer season (International Jumping, Blues Festival, golf, hiking, Mont-Blanc scenery); true lulls late spring + late autumn","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Feb + Easter + top hotels/Michelin 4-8 mo; regular winter 2-4 mo; Flocons de Sel 3-star books well ahead","off_season_specials":"Summer events (Jumping, Blues Festival, golf) + spring-ski value + Geneva-proximity short breaks","event_peaks":"Christmas/NY, Feb half-terms, Easter; summer International Jumping (Jul 11-19, 2026) + Megeve Blues Festival (Jul 31-Aug 2, 2026); winter jazz/polo-on-snow (verify)","campaign_start":"Next winter + top hotels/Michelin from prior spring (4-8 mo); push Geneva-hour short breaks + summer events; lead with ''chic Rothschild classic + 3 Michelin stars + an hour from Geneva''"},"jewels":[{"name":"Gentle tree-lined cruising across Evasion Mont-Blanc","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"adult day ~EUR 63.50; instructor ~300-600/day","timing":"ski mid-Dec-early Apr","draw_rank":1,"hook":"sunny, she